<</Title<FEFF00460065006C00690070006500200053006F00740069006C006C0065002020140020004400650076005300650063004F0070007300200041007200630068006900740065006300740020002600200043006F006100630068>/Subject(DevSecOps architect and coach for regulated, high-availability platforms (SWIFT, Swissquote). I design the release-orchestration and security standards that squads ship through, then coach 5+ squads until the standard holds: golden-path pipelines, SBOM, policy-as-code and DORA-aligned controls. I govern coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Devin) with the same gates as human-written code, and a Java/Linux background means I speak the developers' language.)/Keywords<>/Author(Felipe Sotille)/Creator(Typst 0.15.0)/ModDate(D:20261001085014Z)/CreationDate(D:20261001085014Z)>>
